1
00:02:03,330 --> 00:02:07,580
Every night, the same dream, 
the same strange planet.

2
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,420
But why?

3
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:12,170
What are they trying to tell me?

4
00:02:17,010 --> 00:02:21,350
It's been 34 years 
since they arrived on this planet.

5
00:02:17,930 --> 00:02:21,350
It's been 34 years 
since they arrived on this planet.

6
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:24,020
And not a day passes 
that the survivors...

7
00:02:24,230 --> 00:02:28,060
...forced to live in barrier cities, 
do not live in fear.

8
00:02:28,270 --> 00:02:30,400
I have vowed to end that fear.

9
00:02:30,650 --> 00:02:33,110
I believe my dreams hold the key.

10
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:37,870
The question is, will I be 
in time to save the Earth?

11
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,270
Where are you?

12
00:07:39,170 --> 00:07:40,750
This is a restricted area.

13
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:42,630
Do not move!

14
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:46,210
- What's she doing here captain? 
- I don't know, but we're getting her out.

15
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:49,300
- You're coming with us. 
- Behind you!

16
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:52,430
Hold it right there!

17
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,720
Damn it. Let's move, people!

18
00:08:01,150 --> 00:08:02,810
Two coming through the wall!

19
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:06,740
Hold your fire. 
Those tanks are flammable!

20
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:11,660
Ryan, Neil, let's go!

21
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:33,890
Captain, the transport is not going 
to wait for us much longer.

22
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:37,060
- I understand that. 
- It's in bad shape.

23
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:38,980
I need a minute to extract it.

24
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:41,310
Miss. That's a minute we do not have.

25
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:43,860
I'm afraid he's right about that ma'am.

26
00:08:45,570 --> 00:08:47,070
Phantoms! We have incoming.

27
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:01,620
Everyone, up top!

28
00:09:03,170 --> 00:09:04,210
Go, go, go!

29
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:11,510
- Transport, requesting immediate evac. 
- Affirmative.

30
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,300
Up here!

31
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:23,850
- Captain! - They're right 
behind you! - Captain, come on!

32
00:09:27,610 --> 00:09:29,150
I've got you!

33
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,200
- You okay? 
- Yeah.

34
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,950
All right, everybody, here they come.

35
00:10:11,990 --> 00:10:12,990
You okay?

36
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:13,670
- Welcome back, captain. 
- We're clean.

37
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,090
- Let's make sure of that shall we?

38
00:11:15,090 --> 00:11:16,130
Yes, sir.

39
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:17,590
- Yes, sir. 
- Yes, sir.

40
00:11:28,850 --> 00:11:30,650
Okay, next.

41
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:37,070
You know, my security rating 
allows me to bypass this.

42
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,280
Not today it doesn't.

43
00:11:40,780 --> 00:11:41,990
Something's not right.

44
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:45,200
- About this mission? Or that woman? 
- Both.

45
00:11:45,450 --> 00:11:46,500
Next.

46
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:54,380
Oh shit!

47
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:55,670
- Captain! 
- They got him.

48
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,470
There must be a mistake.

49
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,630
You came in contact with a Phantom sir. 
Please remain calm.

50
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:02,930
Administering treatment shield.

51
00:12:03,220 --> 00:12:06,060
- What level is he? 
- Blue. It will be code red in 3-1/2 minutes.

52
00:12:08,850 --> 00:12:10,230
We have to treat him. Now!

53
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,650
I'm sorry, but that's impossible. 
We'll transfer him to the treatment center.

54
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:14,730
There's no time for that.

55
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:21,070
Get him to the table.

56
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,200
Hang in there, captain.

57
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:38,010
Locating pathogens.

58
00:12:45,010 --> 00:12:47,220
Jesus, look at that thing!

59
00:12:47,970 --> 00:12:49,310
- How much more time? 
- Not enough.

60
00:12:49,350 --> 00:12:50,690
When he reaches code red,

61
00:12:50,690 --> 00:12:54,190
the treatment shield won't be 
able to hold the alien particles.

62
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,820
Engaging bio-etheric laser.

63
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:18,090
We've lost contact. 
Infestation is moving deeper.

64
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:21,170
His treatment shield is failing.

65
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:22,970
Found it.

66
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:33,980
Come on.

67
00:14:08,810 --> 00:14:10,310
It's all right.

68
00:14:13,350 --> 00:14:15,980
Don't worry. 
You'll be back to normal in no time.

69
00:14:17,190 --> 00:14:20,900
Uh.. Doctor, we need 
to scan you for infestation.

70
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:24,860
That won't be necessary. 
I'll take responsibility.

71
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:29,620
Hey, doc.

72
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:32,370
Thanks for saving him.

73
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,680
It's a match. We've found it.

74
00:14:50,930 --> 00:14:52,020
Yes.

75
00:14:52,350 --> 00:14:54,270
The sixth spirit.

76
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:56,850
It seemed today you broke 
nearly every protocol.

77
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:59,860
How long do you think this would 
have survived outside the barrier?

78
00:15:00,060 --> 00:15:02,440
Aki, you know there are 
elements in the council and

79
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:04,860
military just waiting for 
an excuse to shut us down.

80
00:15:59,420 --> 00:16:03,670
If we attack the meteor with this, we will 
eliminate the Phantoms at their source.

81
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,630
General Hein, calm down.

82
00:16:06,170 --> 00:16:07,840
At our last meeting, We voted 6 to 2...

83
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:11,510
...to postpone using the Zeus cannon 
to attack the Leonid Meteor.

84
00:16:12,350 --> 00:16:15,010
We have re-convened today to vote 
on that very issue again.

85
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:19,640
Now, I'd like to ask the director 
of the Bio-Etheric Center to speak.

86
00:16:19,850 --> 00:16:22,230
- Dr. Sid, please. 
- Thank you.

87
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:26,530
As you all know, the Phantoms' nest 
is in the Leonid Meteor...

88
00:16:26,730 --> 00:16:29,240
...that landed here 34 years ago.

89
00:16:29,610 --> 00:16:34,200
What you see now are the records 
of every assault on the meteor to date.

90
00:16:34,410 --> 00:16:38,200
Physical attacks have had 
utterly no effect.

91
00:16:38,450 --> 00:16:42,420
This scene took place three months ago 
during a full-scale bombardment.

92
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:46,750
Now please note the Phantoms outside 
the meteor are indeed destroyed.

93
00:16:47,050 --> 00:16:50,840
However, inside, many that 
were dormant come to life...

94
00:16:51,050 --> 00:16:55,430
...and as you see, 
overall Phantom density remains the same.

95
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:58,390
The newly risen aliens 
respond to the attack...

96
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:01,350
...by burrowing even 
deeper into the Earth.

97
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:04,230
Now, this is very interesting to me Dr. Sid...

98
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:07,530
...because we see 
the same thing during surgery...

99
00:17:07,730 --> 00:17:12,240
...when using bio-etheric lasers 
on Phantom particles, do we not?

100
00:17:12,610 --> 00:17:13,950
Yes, indeed we do.

101
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:16,700
You see. the injured particles escape...

102
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:20,080
...burying or digging themselves deeper 
into a patient's body.

103
00:17:20,290 --> 00:17:25,210
And when we increase the laser power 
to destroy these deeper particles...

104
00:17:25,590 --> 00:17:29,550
...we have had incidents resulting in 
further injury to a patient...

105
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:31,590
...and in some cases...

106
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:32,930
...death.

107
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:35,220
And what exactly does that mean doctor?

108
00:17:35,470 --> 00:17:37,890
It means there's a very good chance...

109
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:41,350
...the beam from the Zeus cannon 
will burn the Phantoms in the meteor.

110
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:42,730
Exactly! Thank you.

111
00:17:42,940 --> 00:17:47,610
However, it also means that 
the beam energy may be too strong...

112
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:49,280
...injuring the Earth.

113
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,490
Injure the Earth?

114
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,780
You mean the Gaia.

115
00:17:53,990 --> 00:17:56,950
- I mean... 
- You mean the spirit of the Earth.

116
00:17:58,660 --> 00:18:02,290
Yes, the spirit of the Earth.

117
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,790
Did he say what I think he said?

118
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,130
What are you doing?

119
00:18:06,330 --> 00:18:09,250
I know what I'm doing and 
whatever you do, keep your mouth shut.

120
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,670
This is ridiculous.

121
00:18:10,710 --> 00:18:12,630
Dr. Sid, the Gaia theory 
has not been proven.

122
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:17,680
Even if Gaia does exist, won't we 
still have to remove the Phantoms?

123
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:21,100
I think if there's any chance of success, 
we should take it.

124
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:23,430
- Don't you agree? 
- Well, of course i do.

125
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:26,100
But there is an alternative 
to the space cannon.

126
00:18:26,310 --> 00:18:27,440
Another method?

127
00:18:27,650 --> 00:18:31,110
- Yes. A means of disabling the Phantoms. 
- Please.

128
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:36,450
As we know, the aliens display 
a distinct energy pattern.

129
00:18:37,370 --> 00:18:40,830
Now, it is a fact that 
two opposing bio-etheric waves...

130
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:43,580
...placed one over the other 
will cancel each other out.

131
00:18:43,790 --> 00:18:47,080
It is theoretically possible 
to construct a wave pattern...

132
00:18:47,330 --> 00:18:49,420
...in direct opposition 
to the Phantom energy.

133
00:18:49,630 --> 00:18:52,800
We are currently assembling such 
a wave and are nearing completion.

134
00:18:53,010 --> 00:18:54,630
Members of the council...

135
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:58,010
...gathering plants and animals...

136
00:18:58,220 --> 00:19:01,640
...from around the world to fight 
the Phantoms is utter nonsense.

137
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:05,810
The Zeus cannon is a proven, 
effective weapon.

138
00:19:06,060 --> 00:19:08,730
It will kill Phantoms.

139
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:11,940
Can we afford to wait 
for some crazy invention...

140
00:19:12,150 --> 00:19:16,450
...some army of 
touchy-feely plants and animals...

141
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:19,660
...An invention that offers no solid evidence 
that it will destroy the aliens?

142
00:19:19,870 --> 00:19:21,030
There is evidence!

143
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:23,540
Our partially completed energy wave...

144
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:26,330
...has successfully stopped 
Phantom particles from spreading...

145
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,040
...through a terminally-infected patient.

146
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:32,420
Doctor, do you claim to have evidence 
that a terminal patient has been cured?

147
00:19:32,670 --> 00:19:35,800
Not cured. The wave is not complete.

148
00:19:36,010 --> 00:19:40,510
But we've succeeded in containing the 
particles safely inside the patient.

149
00:19:54,940 --> 00:19:58,450
You may have bought us some time Aki, 
but i wonder at what cost?

150
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:01,990
Doctor, I can't keep hiding 
in the background while you protect me.

151
00:20:02,490 --> 00:20:05,200
I want what life I have left 
to mean something.

152
00:20:05,410 --> 00:20:08,830
Will you listen to me? When we find 
the seventh and eighth spirits...

153
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:12,000
If we find them. 
What we need now is some luck.

154
00:20:12,250 --> 00:20:15,090
Luck has nothing to do with it.

155
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:17,670
Faith and hard work, girl...

156
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:21,430
...coz I'll be damned if 
you're going to die before me.

157
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:17,150
Captain Edwards...

158
00:21:17,860 --> 00:21:22,150
...you extracted a Dr. Ross from 
Old New York several days ago did you not?

159
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:25,660
- Yes, sir. 
- What were your impressions of Dr. Ross?

160
00:21:25,990 --> 00:21:29,330
She seemed very capable and determined, sir.

161
00:21:29,540 --> 00:21:32,960
You and the Deep Eyes are being 
temporarily reassigned.

162
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:36,380
You will guard Dr. Ross 
when she reenters the wasteland.

163
00:21:37,290 --> 00:21:40,670
- Understood, sir. 
- You don't understand yet, captain.

164
00:21:41,050 --> 00:21:45,220
Report any aberrant behavior 
in Dr. Ross to the major immediately.

165
00:21:45,430 --> 00:21:46,680
Aberrant behavior sir?

166
00:21:46,890 --> 00:21:52,060
The woman carries an alien infestation, captain. 
We don't know what it may be doing to her.

167
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:54,690
The alien presence could be affecting her judgment.

168
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:57,900
They may be manipulating the doctor 
for their very own purposes.

169
00:21:58,150 --> 00:22:00,990
She's had prolonged exposure 
to Phantom tissue.

170
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:03,900
If this begins to manifest itself in any way...

171
00:22:04,110 --> 00:22:08,910
...Dr. Ross is to be placed under arrest 
and transported here for observation.

172
00:22:10,290 --> 00:22:13,370
It is, in fact, for her own good, captain.

173
00:22:13,620 --> 00:22:14,710
Of course, sir.

174
00:23:54,180 --> 00:23:57,850
I'm convinced that these dreams 
are some form of communication.

175
00:23:58,060 --> 00:24:00,060
Their message still eludes me...

176
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:04,730
...but they're coming faster now 
and that can only mean one thing.

177
00:24:05,190 --> 00:24:08,150
The Phantoms inside me are beginning to win.

178
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:11,490
Our target is 50 klicks west of Tucson.

179
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,240
- Roger. 
- Phantom concentration?

180
00:24:13,450 --> 00:24:15,870
Not good. We've got big metas everywhere.

181
00:24:15,870 --> 00:24:17,910
So it's gonna be a real picnic.

182
00:24:18,120 --> 00:24:21,920
Stick close to me. No heroics today. Okay? 
Everything by the book.

183
00:24:22,130 --> 00:24:23,960
By the book. Right.

184
00:24:30,550 --> 00:24:34,050
If we drop energy buoys here, 
here and here...

185
00:24:34,310 --> 00:24:36,100
...we should be able to 
land, acquire the target,

186
00:24:36,100 --> 00:24:38,140
and get out before the Phantoms 
even know we were there.

187
00:24:38,350 --> 00:24:40,440
And the buoys will attract the Phantoms?

188
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:42,610
- Yeah. 
- For a while.

189
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:55,280
So you're from the 307th's right? 
Under General Hein?

190
00:24:55,490 --> 00:24:59,620
Ever done wasteland recon before? 
It can get pretty ugly.

191
00:25:26,230 --> 00:25:31,610
Captain, rendezvous for evac at 
vector 6, coordinate 279.

192
00:25:32,700 --> 00:25:35,280
Roger that. Stay alert for hostiles.

193
00:25:53,550 --> 00:25:55,800
Looks like they've taken the bait.

194
00:26:11,360 --> 00:26:14,530
The seventh spirit should be 
just beyond that line of wreckage.

195
00:26:14,740 --> 00:26:17,620
I don't see how any living thing 
could survive out here?

196
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:19,160
We'll find out soon enough.

197
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:24,580
This was the Phantom Cleansing Mission.

198
00:26:24,830 --> 00:26:27,330
It was supposed to end the war.

199
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:32,510
My father's in here somewhere.

200
00:26:35,550 --> 00:26:36,640
All right.

201
00:26:37,300 --> 00:26:39,100
Let's move out, people.

202
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:56,530
I'll be damned.

203
00:26:56,740 --> 00:26:57,820
A survivor.

204
00:26:59,120 --> 00:27:00,620
What's it doing out here?

205
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:02,700
Hoping for life to return.

206
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:05,910
Is that our spirit, doc?

207
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:08,920
No.

208
00:27:23,100 --> 00:27:24,810
We're closing in on the life form.

209
00:27:25,020 --> 00:27:28,980
- Distance? 
- Hard to say. We're very close.

210
00:27:29,310 --> 00:27:31,520
I don't see anything.

211
00:27:36,950 --> 00:27:40,450
- You're not gonna tell me it's him? 
- That's impossible.

212
00:27:48,830 --> 00:27:50,630
It's not the soldier. It's his ovo-pac.

213
00:27:50,830 --> 00:27:54,760
How do you explain that? The pacs power 
our weapons, the barrier cities...

214
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:56,720
I mean it's just bio-etheric energy.

215
00:27:56,920 --> 00:28:00,340
And to create that energy we use 
living tissue. Single-cell organisms.

216
00:28:00,550 --> 00:28:03,350
- You're telling me his backpack is the seventh spirit? 
- Yes.

217
00:28:03,560 --> 00:28:05,430
We have incoming. Captain? Do you read me?

218
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:06,730
- Captain? 
- What? Say again?

219
00:28:07,020 --> 00:28:08,850
You read me captain? We have incoming.

220
00:28:09,100 --> 00:28:10,980
Ryan, get the soldier's pac.

221
00:28:28,500 --> 00:28:30,710
I need a hand! Sarge!

222
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:38,010
- Those buoys? They're not working. 
- Yeah.

223
00:28:40,930 --> 00:28:43,720
- Are you all right? 
- Of course I am.

224
00:28:43,970 --> 00:28:45,680
Let's get the hell out of here!

225
00:28:49,350 --> 00:28:51,400
Something's not right. 
This shouldn't be happening.

226
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:53,900
Something's attracting them.

227
00:28:54,900 --> 00:28:55,980
Aki!

228
00:29:00,450 --> 00:29:04,370
- They're right on us, sir. Closing in fast! 
- Jane, take the lead.

229
00:29:19,130 --> 00:29:20,380
Fire in the hole!

230
00:29:33,100 --> 00:29:34,810
Get us out of here, Neil.

231
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:37,480
- Sir, I would love to, but... 
- Just do it!

232
00:30:03,510 --> 00:30:04,760
- Sir? 
- It's okay, that's it.

233
00:30:06,430 --> 00:30:08,140
That doesn't look good, captain.

234
00:30:08,810 --> 00:30:10,600
We have to get her to a hospital.

235
00:30:10,810 --> 00:30:14,390
- You have your orders, sir. 
- What the hell is going on here?

236
00:30:14,650 --> 00:30:18,360
Dr. Ross is to be taken into custody now, sir.

237
00:30:22,650 --> 00:30:24,610
Lower your weapons. That's an order!

238
00:30:24,860 --> 00:30:26,820
Sir. We have no choice, 
but to relieve you of your command.

239
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:29,540
I won't let you do this soldier. 
You'll gonna have to shoot me.

240
00:30:29,830 --> 00:30:31,370
Stand down, captain!

241
00:31:55,250 --> 00:31:57,330
Hang on, everyone!

242
00:32:02,040 --> 00:32:06,130
That's enough. 
Hands where I can see them. Everyone now!

243
00:32:16,850 --> 00:32:18,390
Deep Eyes, hard to starboard!

244
00:32:39,500 --> 00:32:42,500
The Deep Eyes are returning 
from the wasteland, sir.

245
00:32:42,710 --> 00:32:44,290
Apparently, there was an incident.

246
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:47,380
It would seem the Phantoms 
were attracted to Dr. Ross.

247
00:32:47,630 --> 00:32:50,840
The crew barely escaped with their lives.

248
00:32:51,050 --> 00:32:53,550
And sir, Captain Edwards is still in command.

249
00:32:53,760 --> 00:32:55,260
Issue an order.

250
00:32:55,470 --> 00:32:58,430
I want Edwards and Dr. Ross 
placed under arrest.

251
00:32:58,640 --> 00:33:01,940
All research materials pertaining 
to Dr. Sid's wave theory...

252
00:33:02,150 --> 00:33:03,770
...are to be confiscated immediately.

253
00:33:03,980 --> 00:33:06,900
That might not go over 
too well with the council, sir.

254
00:33:07,110 --> 00:33:09,530
What a tragedy that would be.

255
00:33:09,740 --> 00:33:14,030
This is perfect, major. 
The good captain has opened the door for us.

256
00:33:14,830 --> 00:33:17,240
By tomorrow morning, 
the council will be at our feet...

257
00:33:17,450 --> 00:33:20,870
...thanking us for exposing 
the traitors and imploring us...

258
00:33:21,080 --> 00:33:23,210
...to save them from the Phantoms.

259
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:29,460
How is she, doctor?

260
00:33:30,260 --> 00:33:33,720
- She is dying. 
- There must be something you can do.

261
00:33:34,010 --> 00:33:36,300
Aki is fighting with 
only six of the eight spirits.

262
00:33:36,510 --> 00:33:38,720
We'll have to implant the seventh 
directly into her chest plate.

263
00:33:39,810 --> 00:33:42,270
It took a bullet. 
I think it might be damaged.

264
00:33:42,730 --> 00:33:44,650
We have to repair this panel quickly.

265
00:33:45,730 --> 00:33:50,400
Her vital signs are dropping. 
Aki is slipping away from us.

266
00:33:51,110 --> 00:33:55,660
She needs a sympathetic spirit 
to help hold her in this world.

267
00:33:55,870 --> 00:34:00,540
And I can think of no spirit better suited 
for that task than yours, captain.

268
00:34:00,790 --> 00:34:04,500
- I don't understand. 
- You don't have to understand.

269
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:06,920
You just be with her now.

270
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:10,130
You keep her here with us.

271
00:35:02,220 --> 00:35:04,560
Aki? Where are we?

272
00:35:04,770 --> 00:35:06,650
On an alien planet.

273
00:35:06,850 --> 00:35:08,480
How is that possible?

274
00:35:10,110 --> 00:35:12,280
I'm not entirely sure.

275
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,990
You seem pretty calm.

276
00:35:14,190 --> 00:35:17,450
I've been having this dream 
every night for months.

277
00:35:17,660 --> 00:35:18,700
Dream?

278
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:21,410
Well, whatever it is.

279
00:35:23,330 --> 00:35:25,830
You're really here, aren't you?

280
00:35:27,750 --> 00:35:29,000
What's happening to me?

281
00:35:29,290 --> 00:35:34,050
Dr. Sid is implanting the seventh spirit 
directly into your body.

282
00:35:37,470 --> 00:35:39,970
Something you should see here, sir.

283
00:35:47,690 --> 00:35:49,940
And I am watching what, major?

284
00:35:50,150 --> 00:35:53,610
It seems Dr. Ross has been recording her dreams.

285
00:35:53,820 --> 00:35:56,400
And why would I be interested in...

286
00:35:57,820 --> 00:35:59,070
...her dreams?

287
00:35:59,530 --> 00:36:01,740
This is it. This is our evidence.

288
00:36:01,950 --> 00:36:04,410
She's under the influence of the Phantoms.

289
00:36:07,160 --> 00:36:11,670
Dr. Ross' dreams should be all the council needs 
to authorize the firing of the Zeus cannon.

290
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:15,260
The council is content to hide 
powering inside this barrier...

291
00:36:15,460 --> 00:36:18,010
...while the world dies a little more every day.

292
00:36:18,220 --> 00:36:21,010
I believe they need a push 
in the right direction, major.

293
00:36:21,220 --> 00:36:23,970
Get together a group of your most trusted men.

294
00:37:15,820 --> 00:37:17,940
What are they doing. 
Why are they staring at us?

295
00:37:18,150 --> 00:37:19,690
Not at us.

296
00:38:10,290 --> 00:38:12,250
Welcome back, captain.

297
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:16,210
Is it over?

298
00:38:17,130 --> 00:38:18,800
How is she, doctor?

299
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:21,210
She's gonna be fine. 
But this is only temporary.

300
00:38:21,460 --> 00:38:25,010
We'll need to find the eighth 
and final spirit to cure her.

301
00:38:28,140 --> 00:38:30,640
Aki, can you hear me?

302
00:38:32,980 --> 00:38:34,600
I finished it.

303
00:38:34,810 --> 00:38:36,650
I know what it means.

304
00:38:36,860 --> 00:38:39,610
I know what the Phantoms really are.

305
00:38:40,820 --> 00:38:44,110
Nobody move! You're all under arrest!

306
00:38:55,040 --> 00:38:56,460
We have them, sir.

307
00:38:57,750 --> 00:38:58,840
Sir?

308
00:38:59,380 --> 00:39:01,590
My wife and daughter...

309
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:08,430
...were killed by Phantoms in the 
San Francisco Barrier City was attacked.

310
00:39:08,640 --> 00:39:10,600
Did I ever tell you that?

311
00:39:15,060 --> 00:39:17,230
You've lost family, haven't you?

312
00:39:17,690 --> 00:39:18,900
Yes, sir.

313
00:39:19,400 --> 00:39:21,400
That's why I trust you.

314
00:39:22,980 --> 00:39:25,700
You know what must be done.

315
00:39:33,120 --> 00:39:35,370
Security override.

316
00:39:35,660 --> 00:39:38,330
Perimeter breached.

317
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:42,170
Major, arrest these men.

318
00:39:42,750 --> 00:39:45,760
- Take it easy. 
- Stand up. Go.

319
00:39:45,970 --> 00:39:49,720
You are relieved of your post. 
Don't ask any questions.

320
00:39:51,600 --> 00:39:53,350
Reduce power to Sector 31.

321
00:39:53,560 --> 00:39:55,560
Sir, you do realize that the Phantoms...

322
00:39:55,810 --> 00:39:57,190
What I realize, major...

323
00:39:57,390 --> 00:40:01,360
...is that we must force the council 
to take action against the enemy.

324
00:40:07,820 --> 00:40:11,070
25% of energy pipe alpha redirected.

325
00:40:11,870 --> 00:40:14,790
Lowering power output to Sector 31.

326
00:40:15,910 --> 00:40:19,040
Barrier breached in Sector 31, general. 
They're coming through now.

327
00:40:19,210 --> 00:40:22,420
Oh I think we can easily handle 
a few Phantoms in a contained space.

328
00:40:23,380 --> 00:40:28,300
Relax, major. When this night's over, 
you're going to be a hero.

329
00:40:30,090 --> 00:40:33,890
Alright. Why do you think 
we've never been able to determine...

330
00:40:34,100 --> 00:40:38,310
...a relationship between the human-sized Phantoms 
and the giant ones roaming the wastelands?

331
00:40:38,310 --> 00:40:40,480
If you've spent as much time 
in the field as we had...

332
00:40:40,690 --> 00:40:44,190
...you know there is no relationship. 
It's like a zoo out there.

333
00:40:44,400 --> 00:40:48,070
Precisely. I think the giant ones are 
like our whales or elephants.

334
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:52,570
But why would an invading army bring 
a bunch of whales and elephants along for the ride?

335
00:40:52,820 --> 00:40:55,580
Unless their ship was kind of 
a crazy Noah's Ark?

336
00:40:56,160 --> 00:40:58,540
We have always assumed that the meteor...

337
00:40:58,790 --> 00:41:01,960
...was intended as a form of transportation. 
Perhaps it wasn't.

338
00:41:02,630 --> 00:41:05,460
The meteor is a chunk of their planet 
that got thrown into space...

339
00:41:05,670 --> 00:41:06,840
...when they destroyed their world.

340
00:41:07,090 --> 00:41:11,550
But how could they survive the trip 
across outer space on a hunk of rock?

341
00:41:11,760 --> 00:41:13,260
They didn't.

342
00:41:17,470 --> 00:41:21,140
I think that explains why we never had a chance.

343
00:41:21,440 --> 00:41:24,940
All our strategies are based on one assumption:

344
00:41:25,230 --> 00:41:28,150
That we were fighting alien invaders.

345
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:31,200
Think of the dream, Gray. How they died.

346
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:34,240
Since then, all they've known is suffering.

347
00:41:34,450 --> 00:41:36,330
They're not an invading army.

348
00:41:36,530 --> 00:41:38,240
They're ghosts.

349
00:41:40,080 --> 00:41:41,330
How many Phantoms?

350
00:41:41,580 --> 00:41:43,370
More than enough to convince the council, sir.

351
00:41:43,630 --> 00:41:47,000
Excellent. Sound an alert. Send 
a squad out to eliminate them.

352
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:47,920
Yes sir.

353
00:41:48,170 --> 00:41:50,720
Alert status. Full deployment.

354
00:41:50,970 --> 00:41:52,680
Sir. I have numerous Phantom contacts!

355
00:41:52,930 --> 00:41:54,390
Well, of course you do.

356
00:41:54,590 --> 00:41:57,430
Outside of Sector 31, sir. 
And moving at incredible speed.

357
00:41:57,640 --> 00:41:59,430
Major, What the hell is going on here?

358
00:41:59,640 --> 00:42:01,020
They're in the pipes.

359
00:42:01,230 --> 00:42:03,770
They're moving with the bio-etheric energy flow.

360
00:42:04,020 --> 00:42:07,900
That's impossible. No living thing 
could survive in those pipes.

361
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:12,450
Well, we've got a big one heading this way. 
Meta class, sir.

362
00:42:19,830 --> 00:42:21,200
Oh, my God.

363
00:42:21,910 --> 00:42:23,210
Hold your fire!

364
00:43:09,920 --> 00:43:11,550
What have I done?

365
00:43:58,930 --> 00:44:01,550
- Here they come. 
- But the others! Dr. Sid!

366
00:44:01,760 --> 00:44:04,060
Deep Eyes'll take care of him. 
Come on.

367
00:44:11,520 --> 00:44:13,650
What's happening. Why can we see them now?

368
00:44:13,900 --> 00:44:17,240
They must be carrying a residual charge 
from passing through the barrier.

369
00:44:22,160 --> 00:44:23,450
Behind you!

370
00:45:25,560 --> 00:45:27,140
All aboard, captain!

371
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:36,040
We need to find my ship.

372
00:46:36,250 --> 00:46:38,920
If it was towed inside the city, 
it would be in the military hangar.

373
00:46:39,130 --> 00:46:40,880
That's a big "if. "

374
00:46:49,850 --> 00:46:51,060
Look out!

375
00:46:58,980 --> 00:47:01,070
- Get us onto the platform. 
- You got it.

376
00:47:16,790 --> 00:47:17,880
Hang on, everybody!

377
00:47:37,190 --> 00:47:37,810
- Captain.

378
00:47:43,110 --> 00:47:45,570
Oh, God. Talk to me, sarge.

379
00:47:46,070 --> 00:47:47,110
Ouch!

380
00:47:47,320 --> 00:47:48,660
- Give me a hand, Jane. 
- Right.

381
00:47:48,870 --> 00:47:52,950
No wait! We're risking further injury. 
We need the proper tools to cut him out.

382
00:47:53,160 --> 00:47:54,450
They're in my ship.

383
00:47:55,870 --> 00:47:59,330
- No. No, doc. No drugs. 
- Captain?

384
00:47:59,540 --> 00:48:00,790
You heard the man.

385
00:48:01,500 --> 00:48:03,090
We'll find the ship and be back for you.

386
00:48:03,340 --> 00:48:05,090
- I'll stay with him. 
- Me too.

387
00:48:05,300 --> 00:48:06,880
Nobody's staying.

388
00:48:08,090 --> 00:48:10,010
- Just give me a gun. 
- You got it.

389
00:48:10,220 --> 00:48:12,760
Give him a weapon. Do it!

390
00:48:15,270 --> 00:48:17,060
We'll be back for you, sergeant.

391
00:48:17,390 --> 00:48:18,480
You hear me?

392
00:48:18,770 --> 00:48:21,980
I hear you, captain. 
Now, get out of here.

393
00:48:22,480 --> 00:48:23,820
Let's move out.

394
00:49:14,830 --> 00:49:17,160
A quad-axle ATV. This is good.

395
00:49:17,410 --> 00:49:21,460
It can be used to retrieve Ryan 
and transport him safely here.

396
00:49:21,670 --> 00:49:24,840
However, we'll need to replace 
these spent fuel cells.

397
00:49:25,130 --> 00:49:27,550
There could be some live ovo-pacs in the hangar.

398
00:49:39,270 --> 00:49:40,350
Gray, be careful.

399
00:49:40,560 --> 00:49:41,770
You too.

400
00:50:24,230 --> 00:50:25,310
Oh, yeah.

401
00:50:40,080 --> 00:50:42,500
Neil, do you read me?

402
00:50:42,750 --> 00:50:44,250
Loud and clear, captain.

403
00:50:44,500 --> 00:50:46,290
This baby'll fly itself.

404
00:50:53,880 --> 00:50:55,180
Flight path is set.

405
00:50:55,380 --> 00:50:56,840
Beginning rotation.

406
00:51:00,390 --> 00:51:02,600
Stop the airtray. We have a problem.

407
00:51:02,810 --> 00:51:05,390
I'm reading an impound tractor 
attached probably to the ship.

408
00:51:19,240 --> 00:51:20,740
There's the problem.

409
00:51:29,670 --> 00:51:32,170
The controls are locked, naturally.

410
00:51:46,600 --> 00:51:48,350
What's happening down there?

411
00:51:48,600 --> 00:51:51,110
Nothing we can't handle.

412
00:52:03,040 --> 00:52:06,120
- Neil, what's your status? 
- Almost there.

413
00:52:06,460 --> 00:52:07,100
I want you two back inside.

414
00:52:08,210 --> 00:52:11,960
We're fine, sir. Jane is negotiating 
with extreme prejudice.

415
00:52:12,170 --> 00:52:13,420
Talk to me, Jane.

416
00:52:15,010 --> 00:52:17,090
No problem here, captain.

417
00:52:22,600 --> 00:52:25,220
Yes! Captain, we are good to go.

418
00:53:04,050 --> 00:53:05,760
Jane, get out of there.

419
00:53:06,100 --> 00:53:09,230
Get out of there now! Go! Jane!

420
00:53:09,440 --> 00:53:11,400
Get the hell out of there!

421
00:53:59,150 --> 00:54:01,360
Over here, you son of a bitch!

422
00:56:06,320 --> 00:56:08,410
Gray, come on!

423
00:59:10,130 --> 00:59:12,010
I enlarged the scanning perimeter...

424
00:59:12,210 --> 00:59:15,010
...to include an area that 
we had previously overlooked.

425
00:59:15,220 --> 00:59:17,010
The impact crater.

426
00:59:18,050 --> 00:59:20,100
That's a strange place to find the eighth spirit.

427
00:59:20,310 --> 00:59:21,930
Yes, really quite astonishing.

428
00:59:22,140 --> 00:59:24,480
But nothing could survive in there except Phantoms.

429
00:59:24,690 --> 00:59:25,810
Precisely.

430
00:59:26,140 --> 00:59:29,310
Which suggests that 
the eighth spirit is a Phantom spirit.

431
00:59:29,520 --> 00:59:32,730
I can't explain it at the moment, 
but once we get down there...

432
00:59:32,940 --> 00:59:36,240
- ... you will understand... 
- Wait, doctor. That's a one-way trip.

433
00:59:36,450 --> 00:59:39,530
Yes, I expected that's how 
you would evaluate our chances.

434
00:59:39,780 --> 00:59:41,200
Well, am I wrong?

435
00:59:41,410 --> 00:59:42,100
No, I agree. We probably...

436
00:59:42,100 --> 00:59:46,210
...won't live long enough to extract 
the eighth spirit from the crater.

437
00:59:46,420 --> 00:59:47,080
Then why should we even try it?

438
00:59:48,210 --> 00:59:50,290
Because we don't need to extract the eighth spirit.

439
00:59:50,500 --> 00:59:52,300
If we can't bring the final spirit here...

440
00:59:52,500 --> 00:59:55,050
...we can go there and complete 
the wave inside the crater.

441
00:59:55,260 --> 00:59:56,680
Yes, exactly.

442
00:59:56,880 --> 00:59:58,840
And how do we do that, exactly?

443
00:59:59,260 --> 01:00:01,140
I can construct a device that...

444
01:00:01,350 --> 01:00:05,640
...would attach to Aki's chest plate 
to gather the eighth spirit and then...

445
01:00:06,810 --> 01:00:07,940
And then what?

446
01:00:08,270 --> 01:00:11,440
And then we wait 
and see what happens.

447
01:00:41,680 --> 01:00:44,390
What caused the barrier 
to fail, General Hein?

448
01:00:46,180 --> 01:00:48,020
I'm afraid it was 
only a matter of time...

449
01:00:48,230 --> 01:00:51,440
...before the Phantoms developed 
an immunity to our barriers.

450
01:00:51,860 --> 01:00:54,320
But I am relieved to see that you 
and the rest of the council...

451
01:00:54,520 --> 01:00:58,030
...were able to evacuate to Houston without incident.

452
01:00:58,240 --> 01:01:00,950
It was a terrible loss suffered this evening.

453
01:01:01,160 --> 01:01:04,200
The council has reconsidered 
your proposal to fire the Zeus cannon.

454
01:01:04,410 --> 01:01:05,620
I see.

455
01:01:05,990 --> 01:01:08,210
We are transmitting the access codes to you now.

456
01:01:10,210 --> 01:01:11,500
And, general...

457
01:01:12,920 --> 01:01:15,090
...best of luck to us all.

458
01:01:18,090 --> 01:01:19,590
Prepare to fire the cannon.

459
01:01:19,840 --> 01:01:20,930
The target, sir?

460
01:01:22,640 --> 01:01:24,430
The Phantom crater.

461
01:01:51,080 --> 01:01:55,420
Preparing to drop in three, two, one.

462
01:01:59,970 --> 01:02:01,680
Powering the shield.

463
01:02:04,640 --> 01:02:06,430
Okay, we're over the meteor.

464
01:02:06,640 --> 01:02:08,140
Do you have it in sight, doctor?

465
01:02:09,140 --> 01:02:11,690
There are so many of them.

466
01:02:13,600 --> 01:02:14,650
Wait.

467
01:02:14,860 --> 01:02:18,980
Yes! I'm tracking the eighth spirit 
moving along the crater's surface.

468
01:02:19,570 --> 01:02:22,700
All right. Now let's take a closer look.

469
01:03:02,900 --> 01:03:04,610
Ready to fire in three minutes.

470
01:03:04,820 --> 01:03:08,620
Ovo-pacs at maximum. 
Transferring plasma flow to auto.

471
01:03:09,120 --> 01:03:11,120
Counter-thrusters are engaged.

472
01:03:11,330 --> 01:03:14,160
Lox flow de-coupled. Status is green.

473
01:03:14,370 --> 01:03:18,170
We have something on radar 
over the impact site, sir.

474
01:03:20,340 --> 01:03:21,670
It's her.

475
01:03:21,920 --> 01:03:23,050
Sir?

476
01:03:23,260 --> 01:03:25,760
Just a traitor under 
the influence of the enemy.

477
01:03:25,970 --> 01:03:27,720
Continue the countdown.

478
01:03:27,930 --> 01:03:30,930
We'll take them all out at the same time.

479
01:03:34,310 --> 01:03:38,310
We're closing on the Phantom. 
Contact in 30 seconds.

480
01:03:39,650 --> 01:03:41,070
Target locked.

481
01:03:41,320 --> 01:03:43,990
Ready to fire on your command.

482
01:03:47,780 --> 01:03:50,410
It's a match! It's a perfect match!

483
01:03:50,620 --> 01:03:52,410
- Target scanners ready, sir. 
- Fire.

484
01:04:27,360 --> 01:04:28,530
What was that?

485
01:04:28,780 --> 01:04:31,240
It's the Zeus. They're firing on the crater.

486
01:04:31,490 --> 01:04:34,910
- Aki, Captain, are you all right? 
- A little shaken. Stand by.

487
01:04:35,160 --> 01:04:39,670
Sid, the eighth spirit is not 
on our scanner. Do you have it?

488
01:04:40,250 --> 01:04:41,920
The eighth spirit...

489
01:04:42,880 --> 01:04:44,380
...has been destroyed.

490
01:04:45,050 --> 01:04:48,880
- What are we going to do now? 
- Nothing. This mission is over.

491
01:04:49,220 --> 01:04:51,010
- We have to get out of here. 
- Incoming!

492
01:05:22,880 --> 01:05:24,590
What is that?

493
01:05:24,790 --> 01:05:28,130
If you're getting us out of here, 
you better do it now.

494
01:05:40,020 --> 01:05:41,100
Hold on!

495
01:05:50,450 --> 01:05:52,410
I can't hold on to you.

496
01:05:57,040 --> 01:05:59,540
Unable to maintain altitude.

497
01:06:06,670 --> 01:06:09,170
Initiate emergency landing procedures.

498
01:06:32,990 --> 01:06:35,450
Come in. Come in, please.

499
01:06:35,700 --> 01:06:38,540
Aki, Gray, can you hear me?

500
01:06:38,790 --> 01:06:42,710
Sid, I need to talk to the station. 
Can you patch us through?

501
01:06:45,210 --> 01:06:48,130
- What is that thing? 
- I don't know, sir.

502
01:06:48,380 --> 01:06:50,590
Incoming message, sir.

503
01:06:50,840 --> 01:06:53,300
General Hein, 
You must cease fire immediately.

504
01:06:53,590 --> 01:06:57,890
What you are looking at in the crater is the 
living spirit of an alien's home world.

505
01:06:58,100 --> 01:07:00,680
Their planet was destroyed 
and part of it landed here.

506
01:07:00,930 --> 01:07:03,520
This is not an invasion. It never was.

507
01:07:04,020 --> 01:07:08,150
I see and what have we been fighting 
all this time, doctor? Ghosts?

508
01:07:08,400 --> 01:07:12,990
Yes. Spirits that are confused, 
lost and angry.

509
01:07:13,240 --> 01:07:15,910
Right. And these spirits are 
coming out of this Gaia thing.

510
01:07:16,160 --> 01:07:17,740
General Hein, you have to listen.

511
01:07:18,030 --> 01:07:21,540
Alien Gaia, Earth Gaia. 
Doctor, even if I believed in such nonsense...

512
01:07:21,870 --> 01:07:24,620
...the fact remains the Earth 
is under attack from an aggressor...

513
01:07:24,830 --> 01:07:27,130
...who must be destroyed at all costs.

514
01:07:27,420 --> 01:07:29,880
The cost may be the entire planet, sir.

515
01:07:30,210 --> 01:07:32,960
Firing on the alien Gaia will only make it stronger.

516
01:07:33,260 --> 01:07:37,550
Well, since you're under the alien's influence, doctor, 
I will take your protest to mean that we are...

517
01:07:37,800 --> 01:07:39,720
...in fact pursuing the correct course of actions.

518
01:07:39,930 --> 01:07:44,430
So i suggest you take your last few moments 
and prepare to meet your Gaia.

519
01:07:44,560 --> 01:07:47,690
Continue to fire until the invader has been destroyed.

520
01:08:24,270 --> 01:08:26,390
General, the system is overheating, sir.

521
01:08:26,600 --> 01:08:30,520
We're going to hit it again and again 
and keep on hitting it until it's dead.

522
01:08:30,810 --> 01:08:33,360
But, sir. We're not even sure 
if it's having any effect on the creature.

523
01:08:33,570 --> 01:08:36,950
No effect? We've got them on the run, soldier.

524
01:08:37,150 --> 01:08:41,240
This is our moment of victory. I order you to fire.

525
01:08:41,370 --> 01:08:45,200
- The system won't allow us to fire again. 
- We'll see about that.

526
01:08:46,410 --> 01:08:50,250
Our shield is out. We're sitting ducks in here. 
Come on!

527
01:09:11,350 --> 01:09:14,480
This is not a good place to be.

528
01:09:12,230 --> 01:09:14,480
This is not a good place to be.

529
01:09:24,830 --> 01:09:25,950
Hey, are you all right?

530
01:09:26,160 --> 01:09:29,830
I'm fine. I have to talk to Dr. Sid.

531
01:10:08,660 --> 01:10:11,210
Sid, do you read me?

532
01:10:11,870 --> 01:10:14,000
Go ahead, I'm still here.

533
01:10:14,290 --> 01:10:18,630
We're looking at Gaia. 
Do you hear me, Sid? Gaia.

534
01:10:18,840 --> 01:10:22,930
I think this explains why 
the eighth spirit appeared here.

535
01:10:24,090 --> 01:10:25,180
Yes.

536
01:10:25,720 --> 01:10:27,470
Yes, that's it!

537
01:10:27,680 --> 01:10:29,520
A Phantom must have changed into the eighth spirit...

538
01:10:29,520 --> 01:10:33,440
...when it touched a new life born from our own Gaia.

539
01:10:33,730 --> 01:10:36,980
If so, it would've been given 
a different energy signature...

540
01:10:37,190 --> 01:10:40,190
...that set it apart from the other Phantoms.

541
01:10:40,610 --> 01:10:43,660
You two could not have hoped 
for a better location...

542
01:10:43,990 --> 01:10:46,030
...to find a new compatible spirit.

543
01:10:46,240 --> 01:10:50,620
Whatever you do, don't move. 
Stay right where you are.

544
01:10:51,660 --> 01:10:55,500
Staying right where we are 
may not be as easy as it sounds.

545
01:10:55,750 --> 01:10:57,920
Don't shoot any of them!

546
01:10:58,130 --> 01:11:00,920
You could very well destroy our last hope.

547
01:11:01,090 --> 01:11:04,180
And what do you suggest I do, doctor? 
Ask them to play nice?

548
01:11:04,380 --> 01:11:08,510
Combat strategy is your area 
of expertise, captain, not mine.

549
01:11:08,890 --> 01:11:12,270
I have a reading here in the fissure. 
Do you see it?

550
01:11:12,520 --> 01:11:17,400
Yes! A compatible spirit. 
It must be very near you.

551
01:11:17,560 --> 01:11:20,900
Well? Which one is it? Which one?

552
01:11:21,110 --> 01:11:24,900
I'm having difficulty narrowing it down. 
Just a moment, please.

553
01:11:27,320 --> 01:11:31,120
Doctor, it's getting crowded in here. 
Aki, we don't have much time. Aki.

554
01:13:02,960 --> 01:13:05,210
With the hope of new life...

555
01:13:05,420 --> 01:13:08,470
...has Gaia changed 
the Phantom within?

556
01:13:14,600 --> 01:13:15,890
I have it.

557
01:13:22,110 --> 01:13:24,900
Gray, get in here. I need you!

558
01:13:25,690 --> 01:13:28,740
Do you hear me, Sid? 
The wave pattern is complete.

559
01:13:28,950 --> 01:13:32,200
Yes, I read you. This is wonderful.

560
01:13:32,410 --> 01:13:35,280
I don't see how you could have found the final spirit.

561
01:13:35,540 --> 01:13:37,910
It found me, doctor.

562
01:13:39,790 --> 01:13:41,420
Oh, my word.

563
01:13:42,880 --> 01:13:44,750
I hope you know 
what you're doing, Aki.

564
01:13:44,750 --> 01:13:47,260
- We can use the shield to project the wave. 
- What?

565
01:13:47,460 --> 01:13:50,970
Dr. Sid's theory was right. 
I have it. The eighth spirit.

566
01:13:51,430 --> 01:13:53,550
That's it. Shield on.

567
01:14:19,330 --> 01:14:21,120
I'll blast you all to hell.

568
01:14:28,800 --> 01:14:30,420
Oh, no. No!

569
01:14:34,800 --> 01:14:36,050
Get down!

570
01:14:49,230 --> 01:14:50,690
I know!

571
01:14:53,280 --> 01:14:55,280
But it must be done.

572
01:15:37,990 --> 01:15:39,030
Fire.

573
01:15:39,240 --> 01:15:40,950
Fire, damn you!

574
01:15:41,990 --> 01:15:43,120
Fire!

575
01:17:01,320 --> 01:17:03,530
Don't leave me, Gray.

576
01:17:03,830 --> 01:17:07,370
Told Sid this was a one-way trip.

577
01:17:08,210 --> 01:17:09,790
Looks like I was right.

578
01:17:10,170 --> 01:17:12,540
No, Gray. Hang on, please.

579
01:17:12,750 --> 01:17:14,670
I still have the wave.

580
01:17:14,880 --> 01:17:16,920
We can get through this.

581
01:17:34,900 --> 01:17:36,150
Help me.

582
01:17:46,580 --> 01:17:48,370
Listen to me.

583
01:17:48,580 --> 01:17:52,710
You saved my life once. 
Now I want you to save yourself.

584
01:17:52,960 --> 01:17:54,670
Gray, no. Please?

585
01:17:54,920 --> 01:17:58,170
Let me do this, Aki. Trust me.

586
01:18:18,780 --> 01:18:19,900
I love you.

587
01:20:09,430 --> 01:20:11,390
Oh, it's warm.
